*> trialmig: decode and reconcile a fixed-length EBCDIC clinical-trial export.
*> One pass. Every detail record ends WRITTEN, REJECTED or HELD; the identity
*> read = written + rejected + held is asserted before anything is promoted.
*> Checksum-failed and unknown-type records are attributed to the open cohort by
*> position, because their own cohort bytes cannot be trusted.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TRIALMIG.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-INPUT-NAME ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL
        ACCESS MODE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS WS-FS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC PIC X(120).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY RCODES.
COPY CAPS.
COPY LEDGER.
COPY TMSTATE.
COPY PATTAB.
01 RAW-REC.
   COPY RECHDR.
01 ASC-REC.
   COPY RECHDR REPLACING LEADING ==RF-== BY ==AF-== LEADING ==RB-== BY ==AB-==.
01 WS-FS PIC XX.
01 WS-INPUT-NAME PIC X(256).
01 WS-RUNNAME PIC X(60).
01 WS-ARGC PIC 9(3).
01 WS-ENVV PIC X(256).
01 WS-FINFO.
   05 FI-SIZE PIC X(8) COMP-X.
   05 FI-DATE PIC X(8).
01 WS-FSIZE PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
01 WS-CAUSE PIC X(14).
01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE "N".
01 WS-REC-NO PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-OFFSET PIC 9(12).
01 WS-POSITIONAL PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-GRAND-SEEN PIC X VALUE "N".
01 WS-OPEN-IX PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-UNVERIF PIC X VALUE "N".
01 WS-N120 PIC 9(3) VALUE 120.
01 WS-NONMAP PIC 9(3).
01 WS-KNOWN PIC X.
01 WS-CKOK PIC X.
01 WS-SUM PIC 9(5).
01 WS-STORED PIC 9(5).
01 WS-ST PIC 9.
01 WS-ST2 PIC 9.
01 WS-ST3 PIC 9.
01 WS-REASON PIC X(12).
01 WS-I PIC 9(4).
01 WS-J PIC 9(4).
01 WS-X PIC 9(3).
01 TM-FAULT PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
*> ledger call area
01 WS-OP PIC X(8).
01 WS-LCOH PIC 9(3).
01 WS-AMT PIC S9(13)V99.
*> stage call area
01 WS-SOP PIC X(8).
01 WS-SCOH PIC X(8).
01 WS-SKIND PIC X(4).
01 WS-SLINE PIC X(400).
01 WS-SCOUNT PIC 9(9).
*> cohort field check
01 WS-COH-OK PIC X.
01 WS-CLEN PIC 9(2).
01 WS-CH PIC X.
*> trailer claims and grand sums
01 WS-CL-CNT PIC 9(10).
01 WS-CL-LAB PIC S9(11)V99.
01 WS-CL-HASH PIC 9(10).
01 WS-CL-NC PIC 9(10).
01 WS-SUM-CNT PIC 9(15) VALUE 0.
01 WS-SUM-LAB PIC S9(13)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-SUM-HASH PIC 9(15) VALUE 0.
01 WS-READ-N PIC 9(9).
01 WS-LAB-N PIC S9(13)V99.
01 WS-HASH-N PIC 9(10).
*> zoned/packed/date helpers
01 WS-Z-RAW PIC X(10).
01 WS-Z-ASC PIC X(10).
01 WS-Z-N PIC 9(2).
01 WS-Z-VAL PIC 9(10).
01 WS-PK-RAW PIC X(7).
01 WS-PK-NB PIC 9.
01 WS-PK-SC PIC 9.
01 WS-PK-VAL PIC S9(11)V99.
01 WS-PK-SGN PIC X.
01 WS-PK-STATE PIC X.
01 WS-PK-REASON PIC X(8).
01 WS-C40 PIC X(10) VALUE ALL X"40".
01 WS-PRIM-STATE PIC X.
01 WS-PRIM-VAL PIC S9(11)V99.
01 WS-PRIM-SGN PIC X.
01 WS-PRIM-REASON PIC X(8).
01 WS-D-RAW PIC X(8).
01 WS-D-ASC PIC X(8).
01 WS-D-STATE PIC X.
01 WS-D-NUM PIC 9(8).
01 WS-BD-STATE PIC X.
01 WS-BD-NUM PIC 9(8).
01 WS-ED-STATE PIC X.
01 WS-ED-NUM PIC 9(8).
01 WS-OP4 PIC X(4).
01 WS-DD1 PIC 9(8).
01 WS-DD2 PIC 9(8).
01 WS-DAYS PIC S9(4).
01 WS-DRES PIC 9(8).
01 WS-DST PIC 9.
*> patient work
01 WS-SRCLEN PIC 9(2).
01 WS-PX PIC 9(4).
01 WS-PFOUND PIC 9(4).
01 WS-HK PIC X(256).
01 WS-HMSG PIC X(64).
01 WS-HMLEN PIC 9(3).
01 WS-DIG PIC X(32).
01 WS-PSEUDO PIC X(17).
01 WS-SHIFT PIC S9(4).
01 WS-DS-N PIC 9(10).
*> row building
01 WS-ROW PIC X(400).
01 WS-RP PIC 9(4).
01 WS-CELL PIC X(200).
01 WS-CELLN PIC 9(3).
01 WS-CIN PIC X(80).
01 WS-CINLEN PIC 9(3).
01 WS-COUT PIC X(200).
01 WS-COUTLEN PIC 9(3).
01 WS-NPF PIC X.
01 WS-FG-SGN PIC X.
01 WS-FG-S PIC X.
01 WS-FG-M PIC X.
01 WS-FG-NP PIC X.
01 WS-FLAGS PIC X(20).
01 WS-EDN PIC Z(11)9.
01 WS-ED2 PIC -(11)9.99.
01 WS-ED1 PIC -(11)9.9.
01 WS-ISO PIC X(10).
01 WS-BYEAR PIC X(4).
01 WS-AGE-TXT PIC X(3).
01 WS-AGEN PIC 9(8).
01 WS-ENROLL-TXT PIC X(10).
01 WS-WCELL PIC X(14).
01 WS-HCELL PIC X(14).
01 WS-VISIT PIC 9(3).
01 WS-EVSEQ PIC 9(3).
01 WS-SEV PIC 9.
01 WS-PCNT PIC 9.
01 WS-NARR-LEN PIC 9(2).
01 WS-CDATE-STATE PIC X.
01 WS-CDATE-TXT PIC X(10).
01 WS-SLOT-I PIC 9.
01 WS-SLOT-VAL PIC S9(11)V99.
01 WS-SLOT-STATE PIC X.
01 WS-SLOT-SGN PIC X.
01 WS-RES-CELL PIC X(14).
01 WS-RES-MAX PIC S9(11)V99.
01 WS-ANY-HELD PIC X VALUE "N".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM STARTUP
    PERFORM READ-ALL
    PERFORM FINISH-RUN
    STOP RUN.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ startup
STARTUP.
    MOVE "R" TO TM-MODE
    MOVE SPACES TO TM-CAUSE WS-RUNNAME
    MOVE 0 TO TM-NCOH TM-RC
    MOVE LG-RESET TO WS-OP
    MOVE 0 TO WS-LCOH WS-AMT
    CALL "LEDGER" USING WS-OP WS-LCOH WS-AMT WS-ST
    MOVE "INIT" TO WS-SOP
    PERFORM STG
    ACCEPT WS-ARGC FROM ARGUMENT-NUMBER
    IF WS-ARGC NOT = 1
        MOVE AB-BADARGS TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-INPUT-NAME
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT-NAME FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    PERFORM RUN-BASENAME
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ENVV
    ACCEPT WS-ENVV FROM ENVIRONMENT "TRIALMIG_MODE"
    IF WS-ENVV(1:8) = "VALIDATE"
        MOVE "V" TO TM-MODE
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO TM-KEY
    ACCEPT TM-KEY FROM ENVIRONMENT "TRIALMIG_SALT"
    MOVE 256 TO TM-KEYLEN
    PERFORM UNTIL TM-KEYLEN = 0 OR TM-KEY(TM-KEYLEN:1) NOT = SPACE
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM TM-KEYLEN
    END-PERFORM
    IF TM-KEYLEN < 32
        MOVE AB-BADKEY TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ENVV
    ACCEPT WS-ENVV FROM ENVIRONMENT "TRIALMIG_STRICT_SIGN"
    IF WS-ENVV(1:1) = SPACE
        MOVE "N" TO TM-STRICT
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-ENVV(1:1) TO TM-STRICT
    END-IF
    IF TM-STRICT NOT = "Y" AND TM-STRICT NOT = "N"
        MOVE AB-BADCONFIG TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    CALL "CBL_CHECK_FILE_EXIST" USING WS-INPUT-NAME WS-FINFO
    IF RETURN-CODE NOT = 0
        MOVE AB-UNREADABLE TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    MOVE FI-SIZE TO WS-FSIZE
    IF FUNCTION MOD(WS-FSIZE, 120) NOT = 0
        MOVE AB-TRUNCATED TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    OPEN INPUT IN-FILE
    IF WS-FS NOT = "00"
        MOVE AB-UNREADABLE TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF.

RUN-BASENAME.
    MOVE 256 TO WS-I
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-I = 0 OR WS-INPUT-NAME(WS-I:1) NOT = SPACE
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-I
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-I TO WS-J
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-J = 0 OR WS-INPUT-NAME(WS-J:1) = "/"
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-J
    END-PERFORM
    IF WS-I > WS-J
        MOVE WS-INPUT-NAME(WS-J + 1:WS-I - WS-J) TO WS-RUNNAME
    END-IF.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ read loop
READ-ALL.
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ IN-FILE INTO RAW-REC
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM PROCESS-RECORD
        END-READ
        IF WS-EOF NOT = "Y" AND WS-FS NOT = "00"
            MOVE AB-UNREADABLE TO WS-CAUSE
            PERFORM ABORT-RUN
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE IN-FILE
    IF WS-REC-NO = 0
        MOVE AB-NOHEADER TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    IF WS-OPEN-IX NOT = 0 OR WS-GRAND-SEEN NOT = "Y"
        MOVE AB-NOTRAILER TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF.

PROCESS-RECORD.
    ADD 1 TO WS-REC-NO
    COMPUTE WS-OFFSET = (WS-REC-NO - 1) * 120
    IF WS-GRAND-SEEN = "Y"
        MOVE AB-GRANDMISMATCH TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    CALL "EBCXLATE" USING RAW-REC ASC-REC WS-N120 WS-NONMAP
    IF WS-REC-NO = 1 AND AF-TYPE NOT = "H"
        MOVE AB-NOHEADER TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-KNOWN WS-CKOK
    IF AF-TYPE = "H" OR "P" OR "L" OR "A" OR "T"
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-KNOWN
        PERFORM CHECK-CHECKSUM
    END-IF
    IF (AF-TYPE = "H" OR "T") AND WS-CKOK = "N"
        MOVE AB-BADCTRL TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    EVALUATE AF-TYPE
        WHEN "H" PERFORM DO-HEADER
        WHEN "T" PERFORM DO-TRAILER
        WHEN OTHER PERFORM DO-DETAIL
    END-EVALUATE.

CHECK-CHECKSUM.
    CALL "FLETCH16" USING RAW-REC(1:109) WS-SUM WS-ST
    IF AF-CKSUM IS NUMERIC
        MOVE AF-CKSUM TO WS-STORED
        IF WS-STORED = WS-SUM
            MOVE "Y" TO WS-CKOK
        END-IF
    END-IF.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ H and T
DO-HEADER.
    IF WS-REC-NO > 1
        MOVE AB-DUPHEADER TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    IF AF-H-MARKER NOT = "SYNTHETIC-NOT-REAL"
        MOVE AB-BADMARKER TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    IF AF-H-PROTOCOL NOT = "HB-ONC-0417"
        MOVE AB-BADPROTO TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    PERFORM ADD-CONTROL.

ADD-CONTROL.
    MOVE LG-ADDCTRL TO WS-OP
    MOVE 0 TO WS-LCOH WS-AMT
    PERFORM LG.

DO-TRAILER.
    PERFORM ADD-CONTROL
    IF AF-COHORT = "*GRAND**"
        PERFORM DO-GRAND
    ELSE
        PERFORM CHECK-COHORT-FIELD
        IF WS-COH-OK = "N"
            MOVE AB-BADCOHORT TO WS-CAUSE
            PERFORM ABORT-RUN
        END-IF
        IF WS-OPEN-IX NOT = 0 AND TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) NOT = AF-COHORT
            MOVE AB-TRAILERCOHORT TO WS-CAUSE
            PERFORM ABORT-RUN
        END-IF
        IF WS-OPEN-IX = 0
            PERFORM FIND-COHORT-SEEN
            IF WS-PFOUND NOT = 0
                MOVE AB-INTERLEAVE TO WS-CAUSE
                PERFORM ABORT-RUN
            END-IF
            PERFORM OPEN-NEW-COHORT
        END-IF
        PERFORM PARSE-COHORT-TRAILER
        PERFORM SETTLE-COHORT
    END-IF.

PARSE-COHORT-TRAILER.
    MOVE RF-T-COUNT TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-T-COUNT TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 7 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST
    PERFORM CTRL-OK
    MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-CL-CNT
    MOVE RF-T-LAB TO WS-PK-RAW
    PERFORM CTRL-PACKED
    MOVE WS-PK-VAL TO WS-CL-LAB
    MOVE RF-T-HASH TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-T-HASH TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 10 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST
    PERFORM CTRL-OK
    MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-CL-HASH.

CTRL-OK.
    IF WS-ST NOT = 0
        MOVE AB-BADCTRL TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF.

*> Control totals are 13-digit packed with scale 2; lenient sign handling.
CTRL-PACKED.
    MOVE 7 TO WS-PK-NB
    MOVE 2 TO WS-PK-SC
    CALL "PACKDEC" USING WS-PK-RAW WS-PK-NB WS-PK-SC "N" WS-PK-VAL WS-PK-SGN WS-ST
    PERFORM CTRL-OK.

SETTLE-COHORT.
    MOVE WS-OPEN-IX TO WS-LCOH
    MOVE 0 TO WS-AMT
    MOVE LG-GETREAD TO WS-OP
    PERFORM LG
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-READ-N
    MOVE LG-GETLAB TO WS-OP
    PERFORM LG
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-LAB-N
    MOVE LG-GETHASH TO WS-OP
    PERFORM LG
    MOVE WS-AMT TO WS-HASH-N
    MOVE "P" TO TC-STATUS(WS-OPEN-IX)
    MOVE "-" TO TC-REASON(WS-OPEN-IX)
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-UNVERIF = "Y" MOVE HD-UNVERIFIABLE TO TC-REASON(WS-OPEN-IX)
        WHEN WS-CL-CNT NOT = WS-READ-N MOVE HD-COUNT TO TC-REASON(WS-OPEN-IX)
        WHEN WS-CL-LAB NOT = WS-LAB-N MOVE HD-LABTOTAL TO TC-REASON(WS-OPEN-IX)
        WHEN WS-CL-HASH NOT = WS-HASH-N MOVE HD-HASHTOTAL TO TC-REASON(WS-OPEN-IX)
    END-EVALUATE
    IF TC-REASON(WS-OPEN-IX) = "-"
        MOVE LG-MARKWRIT TO WS-OP
    ELSE
        MOVE "H" TO TC-STATUS(WS-OPEN-IX)
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-ANY-HELD
        MOVE LG-MARKHELD TO WS-OP
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-OPEN-IX TO WS-LCOH
    PERFORM LG
    ADD WS-CL-CNT TO WS-SUM-CNT
    ADD WS-CL-LAB TO WS-SUM-LAB
    ADD WS-CL-HASH TO WS-SUM-HASH
    MOVE "CLOSE" TO WS-SOP
    MOVE TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) TO WS-SCOH
    PERFORM STG
    MOVE 0 TO WS-OPEN-IX.

DO-GRAND.
    IF WS-OPEN-IX NOT = 0
        MOVE AB-NOTRAILER TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    MOVE "Y" TO WS-GRAND-SEEN
    MOVE RF-G-COHORTS TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-G-COHORTS TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 3 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST
    PERFORM CTRL-OK
    MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-CL-NC
    MOVE RF-G-COUNT TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-G-COUNT TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 9 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST
    PERFORM CTRL-OK
    MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-CL-CNT
    MOVE RF-G-LAB TO WS-PK-RAW
    PERFORM CTRL-PACKED
    MOVE WS-PK-VAL TO WS-CL-LAB
    MOVE RF-G-HASH TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-G-HASH TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 10 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST
    PERFORM CTRL-OK
    MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-CL-HASH
    COMPUTE WS-SUM-HASH = FUNCTION MOD(WS-SUM-HASH, 10000000000)
    IF WS-CL-NC NOT = TM-NCOH OR WS-CL-CNT NOT = WS-POSITIONAL
        OR WS-CL-CNT NOT = WS-SUM-CNT OR WS-CL-LAB NOT = WS-SUM-LAB
        OR WS-CL-HASH NOT = WS-SUM-HASH
        MOVE AB-GRANDMISMATCH TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF.

*> A cohort code names a directory, so it must be [A-Z0-9]{1,8}.
CHECK-COHORT-FIELD.
    MOVE "Y" TO WS-COH-OK
    MOVE 8 TO WS-CLEN
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-CLEN = 0 OR AF-COHORT(WS-CLEN:1) NOT = SPACE
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-CLEN
    END-PERFORM
    IF WS-CLEN = 0
        MOVE "N" TO WS-COH-OK
    END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING WS-X FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-X > WS-CLEN
        MOVE AF-COHORT(WS-X:1) TO WS-CH
        IF NOT ((WS-CH >= "0" AND WS-CH <= "9") OR (WS-CH >= "A" AND WS-CH <= "Z"))
            MOVE "N" TO WS-COH-OK
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

OPEN-NEW-COHORT.
    IF TM-NCOH >= CAP-MAX-COHORTS
        MOVE AB-CAP-COHORT TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    ADD 1 TO TM-NCOH
    MOVE TM-NCOH TO WS-OPEN-IX
    MOVE AF-COHORT TO TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX)
    MOVE " " TO TC-STATUS(WS-OPEN-IX)
    MOVE "-" TO TC-REASON(WS-OPEN-IX)
    MOVE "N" TO WS-UNVERIF
    MOVE "OPEN" TO WS-SOP
    MOVE AF-COHORT TO WS-SCOH
    PERFORM STG.

FIND-COHORT-SEEN.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-PFOUND
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > TM-NCOH
        IF TC-CODE(WS-I) = AF-COHORT
            MOVE WS-I TO WS-PFOUND
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ detail records
DO-DETAIL.
    ADD 1 TO WS-POSITIONAL
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-REASON
    IF WS-KNOWN = "Y" AND WS-CKOK = "Y"
        PERFORM ATTRIBUTE-TRUSTED
    ELSE
        IF WS-OPEN-IX = 0
            PERFORM ATTRIBUTE-TRUSTED
        END-IF
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-OPEN-IX TO WS-LCOH
    MOVE LG-ADDREAD TO WS-OP
    MOVE 0 TO WS-AMT
    PERFORM LG
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-KNOWN = "N" MOVE RJ-BADTYPE TO WS-REASON
        WHEN WS-CKOK = "N"
            MOVE RJ-CHECKSUM TO WS-REASON
            MOVE "Y" TO WS-UNVERIF
    END-EVALUATE
    IF WS-REASON NOT = RJ-CHECKSUM
        PERFORM FEED-HASH
    END-IF
    IF WS-REASON = SPACES
        PERFORM VALIDATE-DETAIL
    END-IF
    IF WS-REASON NOT = SPACES
        PERFORM REJECT-RECORD
    END-IF.

ATTRIBUTE-TRUSTED.
    PERFORM CHECK-COHORT-FIELD
    IF WS-COH-OK = "N"
        MOVE AB-BADCOHORT TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    IF WS-OPEN-IX NOT = 0 AND TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) NOT = AF-COHORT
        MOVE AB-INTERLEAVE TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    IF WS-OPEN-IX = 0
        PERFORM FIND-COHORT-SEEN
        IF WS-PFOUND NOT = 0
            MOVE AB-INTERLEAVE TO WS-CAUSE
            PERFORM ABORT-RUN
        END-IF
        PERFORM OPEN-NEW-COHORT
    END-IF.

*> Hash total: digit characters of src_id read as an integer, mod 10^10.
FEED-HASH.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-DS-N
    PERFORM VARYING WS-X FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-X > 10
        IF AF-P-SRCID(WS-X:1) >= "0" AND AF-P-SRCID(WS-X:1) <= "9"
            COMPUTE WS-DS-N = WS-DS-N * 10 + FUNCTION NUMVAL(AF-P-SRCID(WS-X:1))
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE LG-ADDHASH TO WS-OP
    MOVE WS-OPEN-IX TO WS-LCOH
    MOVE WS-DS-N TO WS-AMT
    PERFORM LG.

REJECT-RECORD.
    MOVE LG-MARKREJT TO WS-OP
    MOVE WS-OPEN-IX TO WS-LCOH
    MOVE 0 TO WS-AMT
    PERFORM LG
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ROW
    MOVE 1 TO WS-RP
    MOVE WS-REC-NO TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    MOVE WS-OFFSET TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CIN
    MOVE AF-TYPE TO WS-CIN(1:1)
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT-1
    MOVE TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-REASON TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE "PUT" TO WS-SOP
    MOVE "REJ" TO WS-SKIND
    MOVE WS-ROW TO WS-SLINE
    MOVE TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) TO WS-SCOH
    PERFORM STG
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-SLINE
    STRING "REC " WS-REC-NO " " FUNCTION TRIM(TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX)) " REJECT "
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-REASON) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-SLINE
    MOVE "LOG" TO WS-SOP
    PERFORM STG.

VALIDATE-DETAIL.
    IF AF-TYPE = "L"
        PERFORM DECODE-PRIMARY
    END-IF
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN AF-REV NOT = "1" MOVE RJ-REVISION TO WS-REASON
        WHEN AF-RESV NOT = SPACES MOVE RJ-RESERVED TO WS-REASON
        WHEN AF-P-SRCID = SPACES MOVE RJ-BADID TO WS-REASON
        WHEN AF-TYPE = "P" PERFORM DO-PATIENT
        WHEN AF-TYPE = "L" PERFORM DO-LAB
        WHEN OTHER PERFORM DO-AE
    END-EVALUATE.

*> The primary result feeds the lab control total before any other check, because
*> every trusted record's bytes count towards the exporter's totals.
DECODE-PRIMARY.
    MOVE RF-L-RESULT TO WS-PK-RAW
    MOVE 5 TO WS-PK-NB
    MOVE 2 TO WS-PK-SC
    PERFORM DECODE-PACKED
    MOVE WS-PK-STATE TO WS-PRIM-STATE
    MOVE WS-PK-VAL TO WS-PRIM-VAL
    MOVE WS-PK-SGN TO WS-PRIM-SGN
    MOVE WS-PK-REASON TO WS-PRIM-REASON
    EVALUATE WS-PRIM-STATE
        WHEN "B" MOVE "Y" TO WS-UNVERIF
        WHEN "O"
            IF WS-PRIM-VAL NOT = 9999999.99
                MOVE LG-ADDLAB TO WS-OP
                MOVE WS-OPEN-IX TO WS-LCOH
                MOVE WS-PRIM-VAL TO WS-AMT
                PERFORM LG
            END-IF
    END-EVALUATE.

*> In: WS-PK-RAW/NB/SC. Out: state M (missing) O (ok) B (bad), value, sign flag.
DECODE-PACKED.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-PK-SGN
    MOVE 0 TO WS-PK-VAL
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-PK-REASON
    IF WS-PK-RAW(1:WS-PK-NB) = WS-C40(1:WS-PK-NB)
        OR WS-PK-RAW(1:WS-PK-NB) = LOW-VALUES
        MOVE "M" TO WS-PK-STATE
    ELSE
        CALL "PACKDEC" USING WS-PK-RAW WS-PK-NB WS-PK-SC TM-STRICT
            WS-PK-VAL WS-PK-SGN WS-ST
        EVALUATE WS-ST
            WHEN 0 MOVE "O" TO WS-PK-STATE
            WHEN 1 MOVE "B" TO WS-PK-STATE MOVE RJ-NUMCLASS TO WS-PK-REASON
            WHEN OTHER MOVE "B" TO WS-PK-STATE MOVE RJ-BADSIGN TO WS-PK-REASON
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.

*> In: WS-D-RAW/WS-D-ASC. Out: state M missing, O valid, B bad date, N not numeric.
DATE-STATE.
    MOVE WS-D-RAW TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE WS-D-ASC TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 8 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST3
    MOVE 0 TO WS-D-NUM
    IF WS-ST3 NOT = 0
        MOVE "N" TO WS-D-STATE
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-D-NUM
        MOVE "MISS" TO WS-OP4
        PERFORM CALL-DATE
        IF WS-DRES = 1
            MOVE "M" TO WS-D-STATE
        ELSE
            MOVE "VALD" TO WS-OP4
            PERFORM CALL-DATE
            IF WS-DST = 0
                MOVE "O" TO WS-D-STATE
            ELSE
                MOVE "B" TO WS-D-STATE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.

CALL-DATE.
    MOVE WS-D-NUM TO WS-DD1
    MOVE 0 TO WS-DD2 WS-DAYS
    CALL "DATEUTIL" USING WS-OP4 WS-DD1 WS-DD2 WS-DAYS WS-DRES WS-DST.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ P record
DO-PATIENT.
    MOVE RF-P-WEIGHT TO WS-PK-RAW
    MOVE 3 TO WS-PK-NB
    MOVE 1 TO WS-PK-SC
    PERFORM DECODE-PACKED
    MOVE WS-PK-STATE TO WS-SLOT-STATE
    MOVE WS-PK-VAL TO WS-SLOT-VAL
    MOVE WS-PK-SGN TO WS-SLOT-SGN
    IF WS-PK-STATE = "B"
        MOVE WS-PK-REASON TO WS-REASON
    ELSE
        MOVE "N" TO WS-FG-SGN WS-FG-S WS-FG-M WS-FG-NP
        PERFORM FORMAT-WEIGHT
        MOVE RF-P-HEIGHT TO WS-PK-RAW
        PERFORM DECODE-PACKED
        IF WS-PK-STATE = "B"
            MOVE WS-PK-REASON TO WS-REASON
        ELSE
            PERFORM FORMAT-HEIGHT
            PERFORM PATIENT-DATES
        END-IF
    END-IF.

*> Weight and height are tenths; the cell is empty when missing (flag M).
FORMAT-WEIGHT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-WCELL
    EVALUATE WS-SLOT-STATE
        WHEN "M" MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-M
        WHEN "O"
            IF WS-SLOT-SGN = "Y"
                MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-SGN
            END-IF
            MOVE WS-SLOT-VAL TO WS-ED1
            MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ED1) TO WS-WCELL
    END-EVALUATE.

FORMAT-HEIGHT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-HCELL
    EVALUATE WS-PK-STATE
        WHEN "M" MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-M
        WHEN "O"
            IF WS-PK-SGN = "Y"
                MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-SGN
            END-IF
            MOVE WS-PK-VAL TO WS-ED1
            MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ED1) TO WS-HCELL
    END-EVALUATE.

PATIENT-DATES.
    MOVE RF-P-BIRTH TO WS-D-RAW
    MOVE AF-P-BIRTH TO WS-D-ASC
    PERFORM DATE-STATE
    MOVE WS-D-STATE TO WS-BD-STATE
    MOVE WS-D-NUM TO WS-BD-NUM
    MOVE RF-P-ENROLL TO WS-D-RAW
    MOVE AF-P-ENROLL TO WS-D-ASC
    PERFORM DATE-STATE
    MOVE WS-D-STATE TO WS-ED-STATE
    MOVE WS-D-NUM TO WS-ED-NUM
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-BD-STATE = "N" OR WS-ED-STATE = "N" MOVE RJ-NUMCLASS TO WS-REASON
        WHEN WS-BD-STATE = "B" OR WS-ED-STATE = "B" MOVE RJ-BADDATE TO WS-REASON
        WHEN OTHER PERFORM REGISTER-PATIENT
    END-EVALUATE.

REGISTER-PATIENT.
    PERFORM FIND-PATIENT
    IF WS-PFOUND NOT = 0
        MOVE RJ-DUPPAT TO WS-REASON
    ELSE
        IF PT-COUNT >= CAP-MAX-PATIENTS
            MOVE AB-CAP-PATIENT TO WS-CAUSE
            PERFORM ABORT-RUN
        END-IF
        PERFORM DERIVE-PSEUDONYM
        PERFORM VARYING WS-PX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-PX > PT-COUNT
            IF PT-PSEUDO(WS-PX) = WS-PSEUDO
                MOVE AB-PSEUDOCOLL TO WS-CAUSE
                PERFORM ABORT-RUN
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
        ADD 1 TO PT-COUNT
        MOVE AF-P-SRCID TO PT-SRCID(PT-COUNT)
        MOVE WS-PSEUDO TO PT-PSEUDO(PT-COUNT)
        MOVE WS-SHIFT TO PT-SHIFT(PT-COUNT)
        PERFORM BUILD-PATIENT-ROW
    END-IF.

*> L and A records share the src_id offset, so AF-P-SRCID names it for all three.
FIND-PATIENT.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-PFOUND
    PERFORM VARYING WS-PX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-PX > PT-COUNT OR WS-PFOUND NOT = 0
        IF PT-SRCID(WS-PX) = AF-P-SRCID
            MOVE WS-PX TO WS-PFOUND
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

*> Pseudonym = P + first 8 bytes of HMAC(key,"PSEUDO"||src_id) in lowercase hex;
*> shift = first 4 bytes of HMAC(key,"DSHIFT"||src_id) mod 361 minus 180.
DERIVE-PSEUDONYM.
    MOVE 10 TO WS-SRCLEN
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-SRCLEN = 0 OR AF-P-SRCID(WS-SRCLEN:1) NOT = SPACE
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-SRCLEN
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE TM-KEY TO WS-HK
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-HMSG
    MOVE "PSEUDO" TO WS-HMSG(1:6)
    MOVE AF-P-SRCID(1:WS-SRCLEN) TO WS-HMSG(7:WS-SRCLEN)
    COMPUTE WS-HMLEN = 6 + WS-SRCLEN
    CALL "HMAC" USING WS-HK TM-KEYLEN WS-HMSG WS-HMLEN WS-DIG
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-PSEUDO
    STRING "P" FUNCTION LOWER-CASE(FUNCTION HEX-OF(WS-DIG(1:8)))
        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-PSEUDO
    MOVE "DSHIFT" TO WS-HMSG(1:6)
    CALL "HMAC" USING WS-HK TM-KEYLEN WS-HMSG WS-HMLEN WS-DIG
    COMPUTE WS-DS-N = (FUNCTION ORD(WS-DIG(1:1)) - 1) * 16777216
        + (FUNCTION ORD(WS-DIG(2:1)) - 1) * 65536
        + (FUNCTION ORD(WS-DIG(3:1)) - 1) * 256
        + (FUNCTION ORD(WS-DIG(4:1)) - 1)
    COMPUTE WS-SHIFT = FUNCTION MOD(WS-DS-N, 361) - 180.

BUILD-PATIENT-ROW.
    IF WS-BD-STATE = "M" OR WS-ED-STATE = "M"
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-M
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BYEAR WS-AGE-TXT WS-ENROLL-TXT
    IF WS-ED-STATE = "O"
        MOVE WS-ED-NUM TO WS-DD1
        MOVE WS-SHIFT TO WS-DAYS
        PERFORM SHIFT-ISO
        MOVE WS-ISO TO WS-ENROLL-TXT
    END-IF
    IF WS-BD-STATE = "O"
        MOVE WS-BD-NUM(1:4) TO WS-BYEAR
        IF WS-ED-STATE = "O"
            MOVE "AGE " TO WS-OP4
            MOVE WS-BD-NUM TO WS-DD1
            MOVE WS-ED-NUM TO WS-DD2
            MOVE 0 TO WS-DAYS
            CALL "DATEUTIL" USING WS-OP4 WS-DD1 WS-DD2 WS-DAYS WS-AGEN WS-DST
            IF WS-AGEN >= 90
                MOVE "90+" TO WS-AGE-TXT
                MOVE SPACES TO WS-BYEAR
            ELSE
                MOVE WS-AGEN TO WS-EDN
                MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EDN) TO WS-AGE-TXT
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ROW
    MOVE 1 TO WS-RP
    MOVE WS-REC-NO TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    MOVE TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-PSEUDO TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-BYEAR TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-AGE-TXT TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE AF-P-SEX TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT-1
    MOVE AF-P-SITE TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT-4
    MOVE WS-ENROLL-TXT TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE AF-P-ARM TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT-2
    MOVE WS-WCELL TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-HCELL TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE AF-P-CONSENT TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT-1
    PERFORM CELL-FLAGS
    MOVE "PAT" TO WS-SKIND
    PERFORM STAGE-ROW.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ L record
DO-LAB.
    MOVE RF-L-VISIT TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-L-VISIT TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 3 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-ST NOT = 0 MOVE RJ-NUMCLASS TO WS-REASON
        WHEN WS-PRIM-STATE = "B" MOVE WS-PRIM-REASON TO WS-REASON
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-VISIT
            PERFORM LAB-PANEL-COUNT
    END-EVALUATE.

LAB-PANEL-COUNT.
    MOVE RF-L-PANELCNT TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-L-PANELCNT TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 1 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST
    IF WS-ST NOT = 0
        MOVE RJ-NUMCLASS TO WS-REASON
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-PCNT
        MOVE WS-PCNT TO WS-X
        IF WS-X > 5
            MOVE 5 TO WS-X
        END-IF
        PERFORM LAB-CHECK-SLOTS
    END-IF.

*> Panel slots 1..count must decode; unused slots must be spaces (else a warning).
LAB-CHECK-SLOTS.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-SLOT-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-SLOT-I > WS-X
        OR WS-REASON NOT = SPACES
        MOVE RF-L-SLOT-RES(WS-SLOT-I) TO WS-PK-RAW
        MOVE 4 TO WS-PK-NB
        MOVE 2 TO WS-PK-SC
        PERFORM DECODE-PACKED
        IF WS-PK-STATE = "B"
            MOVE WS-PK-REASON TO WS-REASON
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    IF WS-REASON = SPACES
        MOVE RF-L-DATE TO WS-D-RAW
        MOVE AF-L-DATE TO WS-D-ASC
        PERFORM DATE-STATE
        MOVE WS-D-STATE TO WS-CDATE-STATE
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN WS-CDATE-STATE = "N" MOVE RJ-NUMCLASS TO WS-REASON
            WHEN WS-CDATE-STATE = "B" MOVE RJ-BADDATE TO WS-REASON
            WHEN WS-PCNT > 5 MOVE RJ-PANELCNT TO WS-REASON
            WHEN OTHER PERFORM LAB-LOOKUP
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.

LAB-LOOKUP.
    PERFORM FIND-PATIENT
    IF WS-PFOUND = 0
        MOVE RJ-ORPHAN TO WS-REASON
    ELSE
        MOVE PT-PSEUDO(WS-PFOUND) TO WS-PSEUDO
        MOVE PT-SHIFT(WS-PFOUND) TO WS-SHIFT
        PERFORM LAB-WARN-UNUSED
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-CDATE-TXT
        IF WS-CDATE-STATE = "O"
            MOVE WS-D-NUM TO WS-DD1
            MOVE WS-SHIFT TO WS-DAYS
            PERFORM SHIFT-ISO
            MOVE WS-ISO TO WS-CDATE-TXT
        END-IF
        MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT-I
        PERFORM LAB-ROW
        PERFORM VARYING WS-SLOT-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-SLOT-I > WS-X
            PERFORM LAB-ROW
        END-PERFORM
    END-IF.

LAB-WARN-UNUSED.
    COMPUTE WS-J = WS-X + 1
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM WS-J BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5
        IF AF-L-SLOT(WS-I) NOT = SPACES
            MOVE LG-ADDWARN TO WS-OP
            MOVE 0 TO WS-LCOH WS-AMT
            PERFORM LG
            MOVE 6 TO WS-I
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

*> One lab_results row: slot 0 is the primary result, 1-5 the panel slots.
LAB-ROW.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-FG-SGN WS-FG-S WS-FG-M WS-FG-NP
    IF WS-CDATE-STATE = "M"
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-M
    END-IF
    IF WS-SLOT-I = 0
        MOVE WS-PRIM-STATE TO WS-SLOT-STATE
        MOVE WS-PRIM-VAL TO WS-SLOT-VAL
        MOVE WS-PRIM-SGN TO WS-SLOT-SGN
        MOVE 9999999.99 TO WS-RES-MAX
    ELSE
        MOVE RF-L-SLOT-RES(WS-SLOT-I) TO WS-PK-RAW
        MOVE 4 TO WS-PK-NB
        MOVE 2 TO WS-PK-SC
        PERFORM DECODE-PACKED
        MOVE WS-PK-STATE TO WS-SLOT-STATE
        MOVE WS-PK-VAL TO WS-SLOT-VAL
        MOVE WS-PK-SGN TO WS-SLOT-SGN
        MOVE 99999.99 TO WS-RES-MAX
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-RES-CELL
    EVALUATE WS-SLOT-STATE
        WHEN "M" MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-M
        WHEN "O"
            IF WS-SLOT-SGN = "Y"
                MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-SGN
            END-IF
            IF WS-SLOT-VAL = WS-RES-MAX
                MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-S
            ELSE
                MOVE WS-SLOT-VAL TO WS-ED2
                MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ED2) TO WS-RES-CELL
            END-IF
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ROW
    MOVE 1 TO WS-RP
    MOVE WS-REC-NO TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    MOVE TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-PSEUDO TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-VISIT TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    MOVE WS-CDATE-TXT TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-SLOT-I TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    IF WS-SLOT-I = 0
        MOVE AF-L-TEST TO WS-CIN
    ELSE
        MOVE AF-L-SLOT-CODE(WS-SLOT-I) TO WS-CIN
    END-IF
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT-6
    MOVE WS-RES-CELL TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    IF WS-SLOT-I = 0
        MOVE AF-L-UNIT TO WS-CIN
        PERFORM CELL-TEXT-6
    ELSE
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-CIN
        PERFORM CELL-RAW
    END-IF
    PERFORM CELL-FLAGS
    MOVE "LAB" TO WS-SKIND
    PERFORM STAGE-ROW.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ A record
DO-AE.
    MOVE RF-A-EVSEQ TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-A-EVSEQ TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 3 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST
    MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-EVSEQ
    MOVE RF-A-SEV TO WS-Z-RAW
    MOVE AF-A-SEV TO WS-Z-ASC
    MOVE 1 TO WS-Z-N
    CALL "ZONEDEC" USING WS-Z-RAW WS-Z-ASC WS-Z-N WS-Z-VAL WS-ST2
    MOVE WS-Z-VAL TO WS-SEV
    MOVE RF-A-ONSET TO WS-D-RAW
    MOVE AF-A-ONSET TO WS-D-ASC
    PERFORM DATE-STATE
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-ST NOT = 0 OR WS-ST2 NOT = 0 OR WS-D-STATE = "N"
            MOVE RJ-NUMCLASS TO WS-REASON
        WHEN WS-D-STATE = "B" MOVE RJ-BADDATE TO WS-REASON
        WHEN OTHER PERFORM AE-LOOKUP
    END-EVALUATE.

AE-LOOKUP.
    PERFORM FIND-PATIENT
    IF WS-PFOUND = 0
        MOVE RJ-ORPHAN TO WS-REASON
    ELSE
        MOVE PT-PSEUDO(WS-PFOUND) TO WS-PSEUDO
        MOVE PT-SHIFT(WS-PFOUND) TO WS-SHIFT
        PERFORM BUILD-AE-ROW
    END-IF.

BUILD-AE-ROW.
    MOVE "N" TO WS-FG-SGN WS-FG-S WS-FG-M WS-FG-NP
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-CDATE-TXT
    IF WS-D-STATE = "M"
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-M
    ELSE
        MOVE WS-D-NUM TO WS-DD1
        MOVE WS-SHIFT TO WS-DAYS
        PERFORM SHIFT-ISO
        MOVE WS-ISO TO WS-CDATE-TXT
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO WS-NARR-LEN
    IF AF-A-NARR NOT = SPACES
        MOVE 40 TO WS-NARR-LEN
        PERFORM UNTIL AF-A-NARR(WS-NARR-LEN:1) NOT = SPACE
            SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-NARR-LEN
        END-PERFORM
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ROW
    MOVE 1 TO WS-RP
    MOVE WS-REC-NO TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    MOVE TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-PSEUDO TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-EVSEQ TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    MOVE AF-A-TERM TO WS-CIN
    MOVE 24 TO WS-CINLEN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT
    MOVE WS-SEV TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    MOVE WS-CDATE-TXT TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    MOVE WS-NARR-LEN TO WS-EDN
    PERFORM CELL-EDN
    IF WS-NARR-LEN > 0
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-CIN
    ELSE
        MOVE "N" TO WS-CIN
    END-IF
    PERFORM CELL-RAW
    PERFORM CELL-FLAGS
    MOVE "AE" TO WS-SKIND
    PERFORM STAGE-ROW.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ row helpers
SHIFT-ISO.
    MOVE "SHFT" TO WS-OP4
    MOVE 0 TO WS-DD2
    CALL "DATEUTIL" USING WS-OP4 WS-DD1 WS-DD2 WS-DAYS WS-DRES WS-DST
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ISO
    STRING WS-DRES(1:4) "-" WS-DRES(5:2) "-" WS-DRES(7:2)
        DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-ISO.

APPEND-CELL.
    IF WS-RP > 1
        MOVE "," TO WS-ROW(WS-RP:1)
        ADD 1 TO WS-RP
    END-IF
    IF WS-CELLN > 0
        MOVE WS-CELL(1:WS-CELLN) TO WS-ROW(WS-RP:WS-CELLN)
        ADD WS-CELLN TO WS-RP
    END-IF.

CELL-EDN.
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EDN) TO WS-CELL
    COMPUTE WS-CELLN = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EDN))
    PERFORM APPEND-CELL.

*> WS-CIN is already formatted (id, date, number): append trimmed.
CELL-RAW.
    IF WS-CIN = SPACES
        MOVE 0 TO WS-CELLN
    ELSE
        MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CIN) TO WS-CELL
        COMPUTE WS-CELLN = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CIN))
    END-IF
    PERFORM APPEND-CELL.

CELL-TEXT-1.
    MOVE 1 TO WS-CINLEN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT.

CELL-TEXT-2.
    MOVE 2 TO WS-CINLEN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT.

CELL-TEXT-4.
    MOVE 4 TO WS-CINLEN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT.

CELL-TEXT-6.
    MOVE 6 TO WS-CINLEN
    PERFORM CELL-TEXT.

*> Untrusted text: quoting, formula guard, non-printable replacement (flag NP).
CELL-TEXT.
    MOVE "TEXT" TO WS-OP4
    CALL "CSVFMT" USING WS-OP4 WS-CIN WS-CINLEN WS-COUT WS-COUTLEN WS-NPF
    IF WS-NPF = "Y"
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-FG-NP
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-COUT TO WS-CELL
    MOVE WS-COUTLEN TO WS-CELLN
    PERFORM APPEND-CELL.

CELL-FLAGS.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-FLAGS
    MOVE 1 TO WS-I
    IF WS-FG-SGN = "Y"
        STRING "SGN" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-FLAGS WITH POINTER WS-I
    END-IF
    IF WS-FG-S = "Y"
        IF WS-I > 1
            STRING "|" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-FLAGS WITH POINTER WS-I
        END-IF
        STRING "S" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-FLAGS WITH POINTER WS-I
    END-IF
    IF WS-FG-M = "Y"
        IF WS-I > 1
            STRING "|" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-FLAGS WITH POINTER WS-I
        END-IF
        STRING "M" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-FLAGS WITH POINTER WS-I
    END-IF
    IF WS-FG-NP = "Y"
        IF WS-I > 1
            STRING "|" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-FLAGS WITH POINTER WS-I
        END-IF
        STRING "NP" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-FLAGS WITH POINTER WS-I
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-FLAGS TO WS-CIN
    PERFORM CELL-RAW.

STAGE-ROW.
    MOVE "PUT" TO WS-SOP
    MOVE WS-ROW TO WS-SLINE
    MOVE TC-CODE(WS-OPEN-IX) TO WS-SCOH
    PERFORM STG.

*> ------------------------------------------------------------ calls and end
LG.
    CALL "LEDGER" USING WS-OP WS-LCOH WS-AMT WS-ST
    IF WS-ST NOT = 0
        MOVE AB-ACCSIZE TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF.

STG.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-SCOUNT
    CALL "STAGEIO" USING WS-SOP WS-SCOH WS-SKIND WS-SLINE WS-SCOUNT WS-ST
    IF WS-ST NOT = 0
        MOVE AB-UNREADABLE TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF.

FINISH-RUN.
    COPY FAULT.
    EVALUATE TM-FAULT
        WHEN "IDENTITY"
            MOVE LG-ADDREAD TO WS-OP
            MOVE 1 TO WS-LCOH
            MOVE 0 TO WS-AMT
            CALL "LEDGER" USING WS-OP WS-LCOH WS-AMT WS-ST
        WHEN "ACCSIZE"
            MOVE LG-ADDLAB TO WS-OP
            MOVE 1 TO WS-LCOH
            MOVE 9999999999999.99 TO WS-AMT
            PERFORM LG
            PERFORM LG
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE LG-CHKIDENT TO WS-OP
    MOVE 0 TO WS-LCOH WS-AMT
    CALL "LEDGER" USING WS-OP WS-LCOH WS-AMT WS-ST
    IF WS-ST NOT = 0
        MOVE AB-IDENTITY TO WS-CAUSE
        PERFORM ABORT-RUN
    END-IF
    IF TM-MODE = "R"
        PERFORM PROMOTE-ALL
    END-IF
    MOVE LG-GETREJT TO WS-OP
    MOVE 0 TO WS-LCOH WS-AMT
    PERFORM LG
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-ANY-HELD = "Y" MOVE 8 TO TM-RC
        WHEN WS-AMT > 0 MOVE 4 TO TM-RC
        WHEN OTHER MOVE 0 TO TM-RC
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE "QUIT" TO WS-SOP
    PERFORM STG
    CALL "RECONRPT" USING TMSTATE WS-RUNNAME
    MOVE TM-RC TO RETURN-CODE.

PROMOTE-ALL.
    MOVE "PRMINIT" TO WS-SOP
    PERFORM STG
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > TM-NCOH
        MOVE "PROMOTE" TO WS-SOP
        MOVE TC-CODE(WS-I) TO WS-SCOH
        IF TC-STATUS(WS-I) = "P"
            MOVE "WRIT" TO WS-SKIND
        ELSE
            MOVE "HELD" TO WS-SKIND
        END-IF
        PERFORM STG
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE "PRMDONE" TO WS-SOP
    PERFORM STG
    MOVE "ROWS" TO WS-SOP
    MOVE "PAT" TO WS-SKIND
    PERFORM STG
    MOVE 1 TO WS-LCOH
    PERFORM ADD-ROWS
    MOVE "LAB" TO WS-SKIND
    PERFORM STG
    MOVE 2 TO WS-LCOH
    PERFORM ADD-ROWS
    MOVE "AE" TO WS-SKIND
    PERFORM STG
    MOVE 3 TO WS-LCOH
    PERFORM ADD-ROWS
    MOVE "REJ" TO WS-SKIND
    PERFORM STG
    MOVE 4 TO WS-LCOH
    PERFORM ADD-ROWS.

ADD-ROWS.
    MOVE LG-ADDROW TO WS-OP
    MOVE WS-SCOUNT TO WS-AMT
    PERFORM LG.

ABORT-RUN.
    MOVE 12 TO TM-RC
    MOVE WS-CAUSE TO TM-CAUSE
    MOVE "QUIT" TO WS-SOP
    CALL "STAGEIO" USING WS-SOP WS-SCOH WS-SKIND WS-SLINE WS-SCOUNT WS-ST
    CALL "RECONRPT" USING TMSTATE WS-RUNNAME
    DISPLAY "trialmig: abort " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CAUSE) UPON SYSERR
    MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE
    STOP RUN.
